{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他从前总想退回心里的安宁来护住那种生活，可光退回来，妨碍它的事仍会继续。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回心里\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他带着对那种生活的牵挂继续往前，发现眼前做的事也在替它争取，旧愿反倒近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"旧愿反倒近了\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"这让他心里敞亮起来，不再因肩上有事就嫌自己还牵挂着它，反倒更有劲往前。\",\n      \"key\": \"更有劲往前\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再卖力也未必护得住那种生活，得留心眼前的做法有没有伤到它。\",\n      \"key\": \"留心眼前的做法\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"怀疑和疲惫过后，他想起曾有的安宁仍高兴，不觉得从前快乐白费，那种生活还没回来，能护住多少没把握。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐白费\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己还会累，真要付出代价时，也可能又想退回安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"付出代价\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他松开绷着的劲，做眼前的事曾让他有力气，那种安宁也真让他满足过，两样都让他愿意继续，不再找更多理由。\",\n      \"key\": \"松开绷着的劲\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留从前想退回安宁、如今带着牵挂继续行动的转变。旧愿不再只是让他想退回去的东西，眼前的事也成了替它争取的方式。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的坚持原则改成具体顾虑：再卖力也未必护得住想要的生活，把自己逼得太紧还可能伤到它。保留行动方式必须顾及所爱这一判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"不直接宣布两种心意已经和解，而是保留责任不再使他嫌弃自己的牵挂，以及行动曾给他力气、安宁曾给他满足这两份真实经历。两样都能支持他继续，却不代表代价已经消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R72\", \"R73\", \"R75\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留想起安宁时重新感到的快乐，不因愿望未成就把过去的快乐说成白费；同时写明那种生活还没回来、努力能护住多少仍没把握，避免抽象地宣布两种需要互不否定。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R74\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-6\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把未来仍可能动摇具体写成疲惫或付出代价时又想退回安宁；结果未知并入现实尚未改变的事实，不再重复概括不确定性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他不再需要更多证明才肯向前，并补出行动本身曾给他的力气、安宁本身曾给他的满足。结尾因此有真实的心理依据，也能解释他为何松开绷紧的劲，而不是靠更猛烈的自我催逼收束。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "551b0a7e-37ea-4ad9-b970-446ebd97ff8e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223719223461Z", "elapsed_seconds": 479.796, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:45:19.036182+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cdaa85a4a95ce3e716c0a8139f63b8f8e23dfb89c816af3e8e2f8966a174725f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T223719223461Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a790e97be05c58fcf98365a2dc835e326bd28b53c8d4222520b5d587f27